\tag{fdip}
\title{Finite reflection forms and their restrictions}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{Reflection pairs an observable supported in one half with its
reflected conjugate. The sign of that pairing depends on the
functional, the reflection and the chosen half together. Finite
linear algebra gives a test that retains all three choices.}

